# Event GH Backend Standards

## Laravel Conventions
- Use Laravel patterns and generators (`php artisan make:*`) for new backend classes.
- Keep explicit parameter and return types on methods.
- Use validation and clear authorization checks in controllers/services.

## Domain and Security
- `User.role` is `client` or `admin`; enforce admin authorization manually in code.
- Preserve reservation workflow consistency (`en_attente` -> `confirmee` or `annulee`).
- Do not introduce new dependencies or restructure base directories without explicit approval.

## Quality Gates
- Add or update automated tests for behavior changes.
- Run targeted tests first: `php artisan test --compact --filter=...`.
- Run formatter for changed PHP files: `vendor/bin/pint --dirty --format agent`.
